cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cuban, please cite the accompanying paper (in press)."
title: cuban
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/burgshrimps/cuban
authors:
  - family-names: Alavi
    given-names: Nico
abstract: >-
  cuban renders multi-panel figures for manually inspecting the sequencing
  evidence behind structural variant calls: coverage, repeat elements,
  insert-size outliers, discordant read pairs, and per-read CIGAR
  alignments around the breakpoints, straight from BAM files.
